-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.1.2 (2026-10-16)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * ipwatchd: skipped at boot while no interface has an IPv4 address (it stopped with "No interfaces discovered"), started by NetworkManager when one comes up
  * snmptt: skipped until the Perl module Net::IP is installed, which its default ipv6_enable = 1 needs, unless IPv6 is turned off in snmptt.ini

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.1.1 (2026-10-15)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * The APTus upgrade checker's autostart: status 1 of its normal cases (live system, no connection) counts as success

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.1.0 (2026-10-15)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Working defaults for services that failed at every boot: pkcs11-daemon, stas-config@, urfkill, xfs_healer@, akonadi_control, the sparky-welcome autostart
